    /// PR): link every id in `atom_ids` to `node_id` with ONE multi-row
    /// `INSERT ... SELECT unnest(...) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING` wrapped in a
    /// SINGLE savepoint, instead of one savepoint-wrapped statement per atom.
    /// Written as a NEW method rather than a rewrite of
    /// [`Store::link_node_atom_scoped`] in place because that method has
    /// other, genuinely-one-atom-at-a-time callers (manual single-coral
